    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Dooley Auctioneers are delighted to present No. 30 La Vallee to the market, an exceptionally spacious and well-positioned three-bedroom apartment enjoying a superb setting within this highly regarded development in Bray.\r\n\r\nSituated on the second floor of a small residential block comprising just eight apartments, No. 30 offers approximately 88 sq. m. of bright and generously proportioned accommodation. The apartment enjoys an enviable position to the rear of the building, with a wonderful outlook across the Dargle Valley and surrounding woodland, providing a sense of privacy and tranquility that is rarely found in apartment living.\r\n\r\nThe development benefits from secure, residents-only parking accessed via private electric gates, together with a dedicated bicycle storage area. Residents also enjoy access to a landscaped walkway surrounding the development, with attractive greenery and pleasant views over the River Dargle.\r\n\r\nThe accommodation is centred around an impressive living room, where large windows provide excellent natural light and frame the surrounding greenery. From here, there is direct access to the private balcony overlooking the valley, creating an ideal space to sit out and enjoy the peaceful setting. The original particulars similarly highlight the wall-to-wall windows, balcony and uninterrupted outlook across the Dargle Valley. \r\n\r\nThe separate kitchen/dining area is well proportioned, with ample space for both cooking and dining. There are three generous double bedrooms, making this a particularly versatile apartment for families, downsizers or purchasers requiring a home office. The main bedroom benefits from its own ensuite, while a separate family bathroom serves the remaining accommodation. Both the ensuite and main bathroom have recently been upgraded and are finished to a high standard with underfloor heating. \r\n\r\nThe property has been well maintained and offers an excellent opportunity for a purchaser seeking a substantial apartment in an established development, while still being within easy reach of Bray Town Centre and the surrounding transport network.\r\n\r\n\r\nAccommodation\r\n\r\nEntrance Hallway\r\nA welcoming entrance hallway providing access to the principal accommodation.\r\n\r\nLiving Room\r\nA particularly impressive and bright reception room with extensive glazing overlooking the Dargle Valley. Direct access to the private balcony provides an excellent extension of the living space.\r\n\r\nKitchen / Dining Room\r\nGenerously proportioned kitchen and dining area with excellent natural light and ample space for a full dining setting.\r\n\r\nMain Bedroom\r\nSpacious double bedroom with ensuite bathroom.\r\n\r\nEnsuite\r\nNewly upgraded, Conveniently positioned off the main bedroom.\r\n\r\nBedroom Two\r\nGenerous double bedroom offering flexibility as a guest room, children’s bedroom or home office.\r\n\r\nBedroom Three\r\nA further well-proportioned double bedroom.\r\n\r\nMain Bathroom\r\nNewly upgraded to high standard, Family bathroom serving the remaining accommodation."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Accommodation\r\n\r\nEntrance Hallway\r\nA welcoming entrance hallway providing access to the principal accommodation.\r\n\r\nLiving Room\r\nA particularly impressive and bright reception room with extensive glazing overlooking the Dargle Valley. Direct access to the private balcony provides an excellent extension of the living space.\r\n\r\nKitchen / Dining Room\r\nGenerously proportioned kitchen and dining area with excellent natural light and ample space for a full dining setting.\r\n\r\nMain Bedroom\r\nSpacious double bedroom with ensuite bathroom.\r\n\r\nEnsuite\r\nNewly upgraded, Conveniently positioned off the main bedroom.\r\n\r\nBedroom Two\r\nGenerous double bedroom offering flexibility as a guest room, children’s bedroom or home office.\r\n\r\nBedroom Three\r\nA further well-proportioned double bedroom.\r\n\r\nMain Bathroom\r\nNewly upgraded to high standard, Family bathroom serving the remaining accommodation."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Spacious three-bedroom, two-bathroom apartment\r\nApproximately 88 sq. m.\r\nMain bathroom and ensuite newly upgraded with underfloor heating\r\nSmall residential block comprising just 8 apartments\r\nThree generous double bedrooms\r\nPrivate balcony\r\nSuperb outlook across the Dargle Valley and surrounding woodland\r\nManagement fee: €2,716.76 for 2025/2026\r\nAttractive, well-maintained communal grounds"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "BER Details",
        "SortOrder": 4,
        "Content": "BER: C2"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Directions",
        "SortOrder": 5,
        "Content": "Location\r\n\r\nLa Vallee is ideally positioned on the southern side of Bray, offering convenient access to the N11/M11, providing excellent connectivity towards Dublin, the M50 and throughout County Wicklow.\r\n\r\nBray Town Centre is within easy reach and offers an extensive selection of shops, cafés, restaurants, schools and recreational amenities. Local shopping facilities are also conveniently located nearby, while Bray DART station and numerous bus services provide regular public transport connections.\r\n\r\nFor those who enjoy the outdoors, Bray offers an exceptional range of amenities including the seafront and promenade, Bray Head and numerous walking routes, together with golf, tennis, sailing and other sporting facilities. The original sales particulars also note the apartment’s convenient access to the N11/M11, Bray Town Centre, bus services, DART and local shopping."
      }
